---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import OrbStage from '../../components/OrbStage.astro';

import { downloads } from '../../config/downloads';
const appStore = downloads.appStore;

const comparisons = [
  {
    href: '/compare/niyora-vs-flo/',
    them: 'Flo',
    line: 'A full cycle tracker that logs and predicts, then stops. Niyora predicts your window too, then helps you through the hard hour.',
  },
  {
    href: '/compare/niyora-vs-clue/',
    them: 'Clue',
    line: 'A precise cycle and symptom tracker built on data. Niyora is the thing you open when a feeling actually lands.',
  },
  {
    href: '/compare/niyora-vs-ai-companion/',
    them: 'an AI companion',
    line: 'A general chatbot that will talk about anything. Niyora is built for one window, the days before your period.',
  },
  {
    href: '/compare/privacy/',
    them: 'every cycle app on data',
    line: 'What nine cycle apps told Apple and wrote in their own privacy policies, side by side, with a link to every source.',
  },
  {
    href: '/compare/moon-ai-vs-other-ai/',
    them: 'other AI',
    line: 'Most AI keeps you talking and learns from what you type. Moon is built for the hard moment and knows almost nothing about you.',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="Alternatives to mood trackers: predict PMS and get through it · Niyora"
  description="Looking for an alternative to mood and period trackers that only log and predict? Niyora tracks your PMS window too, then helps you through it: reflect, regulate, respond in about a minute, plus training that builds the skill. No account."
  canonicalUrl="https://niyora.com/compare/alternatives-to-mood-trackers/"
>
  <OrbStage />

  <main class="content">
    <section class="hero" data-hue="335" data-sat="58%">
      <div class="eyebrow">Alternatives to mood trackers</div>
      <h1>Tired of tracking your mood and getting only a chart? There is more.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Most mood and period apps do the same thing: they log, they predict, they show you a chart, and there they stop. Niyora tracks and predicts your PMS window too, but it does not stop at the chart. It helps you through the moment a hard premenstrual feeling actually lands, and its training builds the skill before you need it.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="moat-section" data-hue="330" data-sat="55%">
      <div class="moat">
        <p>A tracker tells you it is coming, then leaves you to handle it. Niyora predicts the same window, then <strong>shows up when it lands</strong>: reflect, regulate, respond in about a minute, and training that builds the skill before you need it. The prediction is where a tracker finishes. For Niyora it is where the help starts.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="why-section" data-hue="300" data-sat="55%">
      <h2>Why people look for an alternative</h2>
      <ul class="why-list">
        <li>The prediction lands, but nothing shows up to help you in the window it points to.</li>
        <li>A chart of what you felt last month does not help you in the moment you feel it now.</li>
        <li>Your most private feelings are sitting in an account, tied to your cycle, forever.</li>
        <li>You do not just want more data about yourself. You want to feel steadier, faster.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="picks-section" data-hue="288" data-sat="55%">
      <h2>Niyora compared, side by side</h2>
      <p class="lede">Honest comparisons, no trash talk. Many people will use a tracker and Niyora both. Niyora tracks too, so the difference is what it does with the prediction.</p>
      <div class="picks">
        {comparisons.map((c) => (
          <a class="pick" href={c.href}>
            <div class="pick-head">Niyora vs {c.them}</div>
            <p>{c.line}</p>
            <span class="pick-go">Read the comparison →</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section" data-hue="30" data-sat="70%">
      <h2>Not sure the hard week is even PMS?</h2>
      <p class="lede">Take the two-minute check and see how your premenstrual week actually hits.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/quiz" class="cta">Take the quiz</a>
        <a href={appStore} class="cta ghost">Get Niyora</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="/blog/">Writing</a>
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
    <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
    <div class="copyright">© 2026 Niyora. Built quietly in Norway.</div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 72px 40px;
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 26px auto;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: rgba(12, 10, 20, 0.24);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.15);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.15);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.34);
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    section { margin: 14px; border-radius: 24px; padding: 56px 20px; }
  }

  .hero { padding: 96px 40px 80px; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 50%, 75%, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transition: color 1.4s ease;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    max-width: 780px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 720px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
  }
  p { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66); max-width: 640px; }
  p.lede { font-size: 20px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74); line-height: 1.55; }

  .moat {
    max-width: 720px;
    padding: 32px 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid hsla(var(--orb-hue), 55%, 60%, 0.3);
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
  }
  .moat p { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86); max-width: none; margin: 0; }
  .moat strong { color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 84%, 0.98); font-weight: 500; }

  .why-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 8px auto 0;
    max-width: 640px;
    text-align: left;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .why-list li {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    background: var(--glass-bg-soft);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
  }

  .picks {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .pick {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 24px 24px 22px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    background: var(--glass-bg-soft);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .pick:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 55%, 60%, 0.45); }
  .pick-head { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94); }
  .pick p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66); margin: 0; max-width: none; }
  .pick-go { font-size: 14px; color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 80%, 0.95); transition: color 1.4s ease; }

  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; margin-top: 12px; }
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    color: rgba(18, 16, 32, 0.95);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 55%, 0.35), 0 0 64px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 60%, 60%, 0.2);
  }
  .cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
    color: hsla(var(--orb-hue), 70%, 32%, 1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 80%, 70%, 0.45), 0 14px 48px hsla(var(--orb-hue), 80%, 60%, 0.75);
  }
  .cta.ghost {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
    box-shadow: none;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .cta.ghost:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 24px 80px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    font-size: 13px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  footer a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 14px; }
  footer a:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); }
  footer .copyright { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    h2 { font-size: 26px; }
    p.lede { font-size: 17px; }
    .moat p { font-size: 18px; }
  }
</style>
